{"content":"To find the percentage change in the balance of unrecognized tax benefits from 2007 to 2008, we need to use the balance at April 1, 2007 and the balance at March 31, 2008. The balance at April 1, 2007 is $224, and the balance at March 31, 2008 is $168.\n\nThe formula for percentage change is:\n\\[ \\text{Percentage Change} = \\left( \\frac{\\text{New Value} - \\text{Old Value}}{\\text{Old Value}} \\right) \\times 100 \\]\n\nHere, the old value is $224 (balance at April 1, 2007) and the new value is $168 (balance at March 31, 2008).\n\nLet's calculate the percentage change using the calculate tool.\n```json\n{\n  \"message\": \"Calculating the percentage change in the balance of unrecognized tax benefits from 2007 to 2008.\",\n  \"tool\": \"calculate\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"expression\": \"((168 - 224) / 224) * 100\",\n    \"variables\": {\n      \"old_value\": 224,\n      \"new_value\": 168\n    }\n  }\n}\n```","elapsed_seconds":9.367834421107545,"finish_reason":"stop","generated_token_count":306,"generated_token_ids":[1249,1477,279,11414,2297,304,279,8172,315,96139,3742,7567,504,220,17,15,15,22,311,220,17,15,15,23,11,582,1184,311,990,279,8172,518,5813,220,16,11,220,17,15,15,22,323,279,8172,518,5470,220,18,16,11,220,17,15,15,23,13,576,8172,518,5813,220,16,11,220,17,15,15,22,374,400,17,17,19,11,323,279,8172,518,5470,220,18,16,11,220,17,15,15,23,374,400,16,21,23,382,785,14806,369,11414,2297,374,510,78045,1124,1318,90,36167,10388,92,284,1124,2359,7,1124,37018,35702,1318,90,3564,5162,92,481,1124,1318,90,18284,5162,3417,35702,1318,90,18284,5162,3417,1124,1291,8,1124,15136,220,16,15,15,1124,2533,8420,11,279,2310,897,374,400,17,17,19,320,21571,518,5813,220,16,11,220,17,15,15,22,8,323,279,501,897,374,400,16,21,23,320,21571,518,5470,220,18,16,11,220,17,15,15,23,3593,10061,594,11047,279,11414,2297,1667,279,11047,5392,624,73594,2236,198,515,220,330,1994,788,330,57908,1095,279,11414,2297,304,279,8172,315,96139,3742,7567,504,220,17,15,15,22,311,220,17,15,15,23,